			"id": "019cc132-0570-735b-9ece-274b6f916cb0",
			"title": "Ramadan Brings Mercy and Healing",
			"hook": "Healing for what is in the breasts",
			"summary": "Ramadan arrives as a mercy, offering ease and healing for those experiencing life's hardships. The Qur'an, described as healing for what is in the breasts, descends into the cracks of life during this month. Believers are encouraged to show up, even when weary or hurting, as Allah sees and counts sincere efforts. The du'ā' of prophets who felt isolated serves as an example for those overwhelmed. Ramadan reminds individuals they are not forsaken, offering a divine pause for hearts to be gently restored through closeness to Allah.",
