			"id": "019cc133-f0ac-767e-a4bd-92692e799a59",
			"title": "Ramadan fundraising efforts",
			"hook": "The reward is in every generous act",
			"summary": "In the lead up to Ramadan last year, a charity which exclusively works and supports our brothers and sisters in Gaza approached a number of masājid for a tarawīh fundraising slot. The year before, they had been granted a respectable 38 slots. This year, only three have confirmed. In the wake of a genocide where the death toll is beyond a statistic, where the majority of homes, public buildings, and infrastructure have been razed to the ground, for the charity to receive such a poor response is concerning to say the least.",
